+exists, every liveness-bound consumer of this oracle will fail closed and reclaim NOTHING. That is the
+CORRECT direction for a destructive rule, and it is EXPECTED rather than a fault. The remedy is here, in what
+the oracle reports - never in a consumer's bound, which must not be relaxed to compensate.
